{% doc %}
  Sultan of Statues — the Hassle-Free Handover Guarantee.

  One source for the guarantee so the wording beside the checkout button is
  always identical to the wording on the product page and the Delivery &
  Guarantee page. A promise that drifts between pages is worse than no
  promise, and this one is a commitment Sultan is making: full refund, and
  Sultan arranges and pays for collection.

  @param {string} [variant] - "inline" (compact, for beside checkout),
    "panel" (default, boxed), or "full" (adds the buyback offer).
  @param {boolean} [show_buyback] - force the buyback block on or off.
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign v = variant | default: 'panel'
  assign buyback = show_buyback
  if buyback == blank
    assign buyback = false
    if v == 'full'
      assign buyback = true
    endif
  endif
-%}

<div class="sos-guarantee sos-guarantee--{{ v }}">
  <div class="sos-guarantee__mark" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'sos-icon', name: 'shield', size: 22 %}</div>

  <div class="sos-guarantee__body">
    <h3 class="sos-guarantee__title">Hassle-Free Handover Guarantee</h3>

    <p>
      You'll receive the exact statue shown in the listing, in the condition
      described and with all the parts listed. If it arrives damaged, a listed
      part is missing, or the statue differs from its description, you can
      return it for a <strong>full refund</strong>.
    </p>

    {%- unless v == 'inline' -%}
      <p>
        We'll arrange and pay for collection. If we're storing your original
        packaging, we'll bring it with us.
      </p>
      <p class="sos-guarantee__statutory">Your statutory rights are unaffected.</p>
    {%- endunless -%}

    {%- if v == 'inline' -%}
      <p class="sos-guarantee__more">
        We arrange and pay for collection.
        <a href="/pages/delivery-and-guarantee">Read the guarantee</a>
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{%- if buyback -%}
  <div class="sos-guarantee sos-guarantee--buyback">
    <div class="sos-guarantee__mark" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'sos-icon', name: 'gem', size: 22 %}</div>
    <div class="sos-guarantee__body">
      <h3 class="sos-guarantee__title">A free buyback quote when you're ready to sell</h3>
      <p>
        Bought your statue from Sultan of Statues? Come back to us when you're
        ready to sell. We'll check its condition, what's included and its
        current resale value. If we can buy it back, we'll give you a quote
        showing exactly what you'd receive after any collection charge.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you accept, we'll arrange collection and bring your original boxes
        if we're storing them for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
